{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-30f7fc08dd472718aae5ef01b9b95619ff85ee68495d381c","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"ca4b087a5a2b3dd3ab14c5af920cf400106bdbf15c960b7bc5576e644365be90","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Attached Form No. 16] <Amended on April 5, 2007>\n\n(Front)\n\nUse of Petroleum Products for Tax-Exempt Purposes\n[ ] Application for Verification  [ ] Written Verification\n\nProcessing period: 5 days.\n\nApplicant\n\n| ① Name (representative) | ② Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ③ Business name (corporate name) | ④ Telephone number |\n| | |\n| ⑤ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n\nDetails of Use\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>⑥ Name of petroleum product</th><th>⑦ Quantity</th><th>⑧ Unit price</th><th>⑨ Amount</th><th>⑩ Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n| ⑪ Place of use | | ⑫ Business registration number | |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ⑬ Date of use | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ | ⑭ Date of entry | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ |\n| ⑮ Purpose of use | | | |\n\nPlease verify that the petroleum products were used for the relevant purpose as stated above pursuant to the following provision of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act:\n[ ] Article 23 (1) 2\n[ ] Article 24 (2) 4\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Minister\n\nNo. ______\n\nI verify the facts stated above.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nMinister: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\nRequired documents: None.\n※ This application form is distributed free of charge.\nFee: None.\n\nGeneral paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the competent institution</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare application</td><td>2. Receive application (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>5. Prepare written verification</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe application proceeds from box 1 to box 2 on the right, then downward through boxes 3, 4, and 5. The final arrow from box 5 runs left and upward to the applicant and is labelled “Issue written verification.”\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\16c6d617c56f2dc77f0bfab36622a97219e953ce5e6f56f8b1f9257268fc967c.ascii.json","sha256":"16c6d617c56f2dc77f0bfab36622a97219e953ce5e6f56f8b1f9257268fc967c"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"a8a55228e81f669861fc86c2cdce06bc9342282484eaec675c714dea54b1724e","unit_key":"form-001600F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"3c6185744fa2952f4afacd7cf751cf95dd934e6e064c20fe25b9ada599084be6","unit_key":"form-001700F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"a8a55228e81f669861fc86c2cdce06bc9342282484eaec675c714dea54b1724e","source_law_id":"kr-006574-270243-ko","source_review_complete":